      "content": "It sounds incredibly exhausting to feel like you are fighting a constant, immovable force, and that level of weariness is profound. When the structure feels too overwhelming, the thought of complete escape can feel like the only relief possible. Before making any drastic decisions, please consider talking to someone who can help you navigate this immense weight. Connecting with a mental health professional can provide tools to manage the pressure, even if the external situation hasn't changed yet.",
      "source": "target",
